%% HANDWRITTEN. Checked against src/readycall/api/ + D4 + D47
flowchart TB
    subgraph clients["clients - both speak the SAME public API"]
        direction LR
        SIM["<b>customer simulator</b><br/>apps/customer_sim/index.html<br/>one file, no build step (D47)"]:::sim
        APP["<b>the real Krungsri app</b><br/>does not exist yet, and needs<br/>no server change when it does"]:::future
    end

    clients --> AUTH{{"<b>SessionResolver</b> - the seam<br/>cookie -> customer_id, SERVER-SIDE"}}:::gate
    AUTH -.-> A1["DemoSessionStore<br/>persona picker (D47)"]:::demo
    AUTH -.-> A2["the bank's OIDC<br/>one adapter, later"]:::future

    AUTH --> R1["<b>POST /v1/calls/intents</b><br/>mint a correlation token"]:::route
    AUTH --> R2["<b>GET /v1/calls/intents/{id}</b><br/>what the prefetch found"]:::route
    AUTH --> R3["<b>POST /v1/app/context-events</b><br/>a screen they looked at"]:::route

    R1 --> SVC["IntentService<br/>routes stay thin: validate, delegate"]:::svc
    SVC --> STORE[("intent stored -<br/>only the token's SHA-256 hash")]:::store
    SVC --> BUS(["publish <b>intent.created</b>"]):::bus

    BUS --> BG["drained AFTER the response is sent"]:::bg
    BG --> ASM["ContextAssembler - 6 parallel reads"]:::svc
    ASM --> SNAP[("frozen ContextSnapshot")]:::store
    SNAP --> R2

    D4["<b>D4, enforced by the schema not by a check.</b><br/>CreateIntentRequest has NO customer_id field, and<br/>extra='forbid' makes smuggling one in a 422. If a<br/>client could assert identity, anyone with curl could<br/>mint a token for a stranger and walk it to L3 on the<br/>next call - the whole ladder would rest on their input."]:::note

    D6["<b>D6: why the bus, not a direct call.</b> The endpoint<br/>publishes and returns a dial target immediately; the<br/>six reads to the bank core happen afterwards, while<br/>the customer is still lifting the phone to their ear.<br/>Measured: dial target in ~50ms, context in ~1.8ms<br/>after it."]:::note

